<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>What a glorious church life,</l><l>Christ in us has made us one,</l><l>Eating the tree of life,</l><l>We are one!</l><l>How can we ever depart</l><l>Such a sweet and blessed life?</l><l>Christ in us and we in Christ!</l><l>We are one!</l></lg>
</div>
